# No em dashes

Never use the em dash `—` (tiret cadratin) or en dash `–`.

Allowed: normal hyphen `-`, ellipsis `…`, middle dot `·`.

Examples:
- Bad: `Via GitHub Releases — l'app peut...`
- Good: `Mise a jour depuis les releases GitHub.`
- Good: `Vérification…` / `30m · shutdown`
